2025-05-23 23:37:45,643 INFO Product development completed: {'pitch': CrewOutput(raw='**Pitch for the BMW Mini Brick Racer Set**\n\nThe "BMW Mini Brick Racer Set" represents a dynamic collaboration between BMW and Lego, merging the thrill of imaginative play with the innovation of sustainable design. This upcycled toy vehicle is crafted from recycled materials, showcasing both brands\' commitment to eco-friendly practices. Each brick, inspired by the iconic Mini Cooper, allows children to assemble their very own racer, promoting creativity while adhering to sustainable toy production trends.\n\nLeveraging BMW’s premium automotive flair and Lego’s reputation for stimulating creativity, this set aligns seamlessly with both brands\' identities. BMW’s focus on sustainable luxury resonates with environmentally conscious consumers, while Lego’s commitment to eco-friendly materials and imaginative play provides a strong foundation for this collaboration.\n\nTargeted primarily at families with children aged 5-12, this toy not only serves as an educational tool promoting construction and design skills, but also encourages discussions about sustainability in both play and life. The growing sustainable toys market, valued at approximately $22 billion in 2023, reflects an increasing parental preference for environmentally friendly products.\n\nThe storytelling potential surrounding the Mini Brick Racer Set is significant, from highlighting the journey of recycled materials to creating engaging narratives that inspire future innovators. Together, BMW and Lego can create a legacy of sustainability and fun that resonates with children and adults alike, cementing their status as forward-thinking, responsible brands in the toy industry. \n\nWith the combined power of co-branding, creativity, and a strong focus on sustainability, the BMW Mini Brick Racer Set is poised to capture the hearts of young builders and eco-conscious families alike.', pydantic=None, json_dict=None, tasks_outp