2025-05-23 23:45:10,331 INFO Product development completed: {'pitch': CrewOutput(raw="**Introducing the BMW Eco-Block Racer: The Ultimate Upcycled Toy Vehicle**\n\nThe BMW Eco-Block Racer is a revolutionary collaboration between BMW and Lego, merging high-performance automotive design with modular toy creativity. Crafted from upcycled materials sourced from BMW's production waste and Lego’s sustainable plastic, this toy vehicle embodies innovation and sustainability. Children will delight in building their own BMW racer, featuring iconic design elements, while parents feel pride in their choice of a responsible, eco-friendly product. Each Eco-Block Racer comes with customizable blocks that promote creativity, allowing kids to construct their dream car models without the constraints of traditional toys.\n\nThis product leverages BMW’s identity as a leader in automotive excellence and innovation, alongside Lego's reputation for creativity and engineering prowess. The Eco-Block Racer appeals to environmentally conscious parents who value sustainability and imaginative play—targeting kids aged 5-12 and collectors alike.\n\nThe sustainable innovation lies in the use of recycled materials that contribute to a circular economy, reducing waste while inspiring the next generation to consider ecological impact. The storytelling potential is immense; each Eco-Block Racer can come with an augmented reality feature where kids can unlock stories about sustainability, innovation, and engineering through interactive play, enhancing the overall experience. Together, BMW and Lego are not just creating a product but igniting a passion for sustainability and creativity in young minds, ensuring that the future is both fun and responsible.", pydantic=None, json_dict=None, tasks_output=[TaskOutput(description='\n            Generate a pitch for an upcycled Toy Vehicle called "BMW Eco-Block Racer", a collaboration between BMW and Lego.\n            Include:\n            - A detailed concep