2025-05-24 00:12:53,119 INFO Product development completed: {'pitch': "**Concept:** The BMW Motorworks Building Set is a sophisticated play experience that allows builders to create iconic BMW models, from the sleek Z4 to the powerful M3, all crafted from upcycled plastics. This Lego-style set introduces children and automotive enthusiasts alike to the fusion of creativity and engineering, enabling them to explore the intricacies of luxury car design while promoting eco-friendly play. Each set includes detailed instructions and unique customization options, transforming imaginative vision into automotive artistry.\n\n**Brand Identity Leverage:** BMW's commitment to innovation, performance, and sustainability aligns perfectly with Lego's ethos of creativity and imagination. By combining BMW's luxury car essence with Lego's beloved building experience, this collaboration elevates both brands to a new level of engaging play, illustrating that creative minds can shape the future of sustainable luxury.\n\n**Market Positioning and Intended Audience:** Aimed at environmentally conscious families, young car enthusiasts, and Lego collectors, this set appeals to ages 7 to 99, blending education with entertainment. As interest in sustainable toys rises, this limited-edition offering can position itself as a must-have for fans of both brands, serving as a bridge to younger generations who prioritize sustainability without compromising on luxury.\n\n**Sustainability Innovation:** By utilizing upcycled plastics, the BMW Motorworks Building Set not only highlights Lego's commitment to sustainable materials but also solidifies BMW's vision of environmental stewardship. Each purchase supports global recycling initiatives, making every play session a step towards a greener planet.\n\n**Co-Branding and Storytelling Potential:** This collaboration presents an opportunity to engage consumers through storytelling, celebrating the journey of both brands towards sustainability. Interactive